  "_comment": "Which action buttons a completed-feed event qualifies for. The notifier (Notifier.eligible) and jobbot-mcp (Eligibility) must both pass every case. Fields are the bridge's wire names. Apply needs a tailored job (pipeline_action TAILOR): the fill uploads the tailored resume, and a skipped job has none. Tailor needs an offered job (pipeline_action OFFER: a fit below AUTO_TAILOR_MIN_SCORE, not tailored up front); the tap queues its resume build.",
